# Paper corpus. The corpus is committed: the papers are open access, so the
# app works from a clean checkout with no setup. These two are the exception
# -- both carry an Elsevier "All rights reserved" notice -- so they are held
# back. Rebuild any of it with: python -m app.corpus_ingest <pdf-dir>
